'''Fladnag''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the Snowhill Post Office, located in [[Snowhill]]. He sells [[Wizard]] [[Jobs|Job]] related [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Scholar Wizard Talisman]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Skirt]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Slacks]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Fez]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Gloves]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Shoes]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Shoes]]
*[[Scholar Wizard Medium Cloak]]
*[[Wizard's Flair Shard of Subtlety]]
*[[Wizard's Power Shard of Vitality III]]
*[[Wizard's Necklace of Vitality III]]
*[[Wizard's Ring of Regeneration III]]
*[[Wizard's Bone Wand of Lightning]]
*[[Wizard's Bone Wand of Tsunami]]
*[[Wizard's Bone Wand of Glaciers]]

==Trivia==
*Fladnag was introduced in-game on October 15, 2013.
*Fladnag's name is a [[w:c:lotr:The Lord of the Rings film trilogy|Lord of the Rings]] character, [[w:c:lotr:Gandalf|Gandalf]] spelled backwards.
